---
// About - Clean prose layout
---

<section class="about chapter-section" id="about">
  <div class="container">

    <p class="section-eyebrow" data-reveal>About</p>
    <h2 class="section-title" data-reveal="clip" style="--reveal-delay: 80ms">The maker<br/>behind the <em>work.</em></h2>

    <div class="about-layout">

      <div class="about-text" data-reveal style="--reveal-delay: 160ms">
        <p>
          I'm a product designer and systems thinker based in India, working at the intersection
          of AI orchestration, enterprise UX, and complex operational workflows.
        </p>
        <p>
          My process starts before the screen - understanding who makes decisions, what they're
          trying to complete, and where friction exists. I design for environments where
          usability meets operations, constraints, and scale.
        </p>
        <p>
          Before joining Mondee, I shipped AI-native tooling at Kodecopter, a mental wellness
          app at Bloom Majestic, and a government-approved health product at Aakam 360.
          Each shaped how I think about designing under real constraints.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="about-aside" data-reveal style="--reveal-delay: 280ms">
        <blockquote class="about-quote">
          "I don't start with screens.<br/>
          I start with structure."
        </blockquote>

        <div class="about-meta" role="list">
          <div class="am-row">
            <span class="am-label">Currently</span>
            <span class="am-val">UX Designer, Mondee</span>
          </div>
          <div class="am-row">
            <span class="am-label">Focus</span>
            <span class="am-val">AI-native products</span>
          </div>
          <div class="am-row">
            <span class="am-label">Based in</span>
            <span class="am-val">India</span>
          </div>
          <div class="am-row">
            <span class="am-label">Open to</span>
            <span class="am-val">Full-time roles</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about-layout {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.4fr 1fr;
    gap: 80px;
    align-items: start;
  }

  .about-text {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 20px;
  }

  .about-text p {
    font-size: clamp(1rem, 1.3vw, 1.05rem);
    color: rgba(242, 237, 227, 0.6);
    line-height: 1.85;
  }

  .about-quote {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 2.5vw, 2.2rem);
    font-weight: 400;
    font-style: normal;
    color: var(--text);
    line-height: 1.2;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.03em;
    border-left: 3px solid var(--primary);
    padding-left: 24px;
    margin: 0 0 36px;
    position: relative;
  }

  .about-aside {
    position: relative;
  }

  .about-aside::before,
  .about-aside::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    width: 14px;
    height: 14px;
    border-color: rgba(204, 255, 0, 0.25);
    border-style: solid;
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .about-aside::before { top: -8px; right: -8px; border-width: 1px 1px 0 0; }
  .about-aside::after  { bottom: -8px; left: -8px; border-width: 0 0 1px 1px; }

  .about-meta {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0;
    border: 1px solid rgba(204, 255, 0, 0.1);
  }

  .am-row {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 12px 16px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(204, 255, 0, 0.08);
    gap: 16px;
  }

  .am-label {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 10px;
    letter-spacing: 1.5px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: rgba(242, 237, 227, 0.3);
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .am-val {
    font-size: 13px;
    color: rgba(242, 237, 227, 0.65);
    text-align: right;
  }

  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .about-layout { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 48px; }
  }

  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .about-text p { font-size: 0.95rem; }
  }
</style>
